<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hanbo units could face liquidation -- Seoul watchdog.</title>
<headline>Hanbo units could face liquidation -- Seoul watchdog.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some affiliates of the collapsed Hanbo Group may be liquidated if they are not seen to be viable, an official at South Korea's Office of Bank Supervision said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The office will instruct creditor banks to take steps for liquidation of those firms that cannot stay alive,&quot; said the official who asked not to be named.</p>
